      "name": "Ayan Kar",
      "created_at": "2026-02-12T08:33:10.431Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi,<br>\nI modified some DocTypes and added a few custom fields based on my requirements. However, after upgrading the version, the custom fields I added are missing, along with their data. What is the solution to recover my data, and what is the correct method to add custom fields in the future?</p>",
