      "created_at": "2026-02-12T11:53:30.936Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ayankar\">@ayankar</a></p>\n<p>Hope you made a backup before migrating <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/crossed_fingers.png?v=14\" title=\":crossed_fingers:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":crossed_fingers:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Thats why frappe made the upgrade-safe Custom Field Doctype -   <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/basics/doctypes/customize\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Customizing DocTypes</a></p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/asieftejani/{size}/86086_2.png",
