      "id": 494171,
      "username": "ayankar",
      "name": "Ayan Kar",
      "created_at": "2026-02-12T13:08:10.267Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Before the upgrade, I customized the DocType using the ‘Customize’ option from the module page. This time, I made the same changes directly in the DocType, and after adding my custom fields (the same ones I had added earlier), all the data was automatically restored.</p>",
